        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">Semantic & lexical hybrid retrieval with strict citations to official AICTE Approval Process Handbook (APH 2024–27)</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div class="lg:col-span-2 glass-card p-6 rounded-2xl border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm flex flex-col h-[560px]">
          
          <!-- Chat History View -->
          <div id="rag-chat-history" class="flex-1 overflow-y-auto space-y-3.5 p-4 bg-slate-50/80 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 text-xs">
            <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-50 to-indigo-50 p-4 rounded-xl text-blue-950 border border-blue-200/80 shadow-sm">
              <p class="font-display font-bold text-sm text-blue-900 mb-1 flex items-center gap-1.5">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-blue-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 16h-1v-4h-1m1-4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
                AICTE Regulatory Scrutiny Assistant
              </p>
              <p class="leading-relaxed">
                Welcome, Scrutiny Officer. Ask any question regarding applicable norms, fire safety requirements, approved intake ceilings, or documentation validity. If no clause is found in the knowledge base, I will explicitly abstain rather than hallucinate.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Quick Prompts Chips -->
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mt-3 overflow-x-auto pb-1 text-[11px]">
            <button onclick="setRAGQuery('What are the fire safety certificate requirements under AICTE norms?')" class="whitespace-nowrap px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 text-slate-700 transition">🔥 Fire Safety NOC</button>
            <button onclick="setRAGQuery('Which clause governs intake variations and approved ceilings?')" class="whitespace-nowrap px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 text-slate-700 transition">📊 Approved Intake</button>
            <button onclick="setRAGQuery('What is the mandatory TER fee payment requirement?')" class="whitespace-nowrap px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 text-slate-700 transition">💳 TER Fee Realization</button>
          </div>

          <!-- Chat Input -->
          <div class="mt-2 flex gap-2">
            <input type="text" id="rag-main-input" onkeypress="if(event.key==='Enter') executeRAGQuery()" placeholder="Type regulatory query (e.g. Which clause governs cross-institutional document reuse?)..." class="flex-1 text-xs px-4 py-3 border border-slate-300 rounded-xl focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand-500 bg-white shadow-sm">
            <button onclick="executeRAGQuery()" class="px-6 py-3 bg-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-800 text-white text-xs font-bold rounded-xl transition-all shadow-sm">
              Query RAG
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Right: Synthetic Handbook Compendium -->
        <div class="glass-card p-6 rounded-2xl border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-4">
          <h3 class="text-sm font-display font-bold text-slate-900">Indexed Regulatory Clauses</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">Official AICTE Approval Process Handbook (APH 2024–27):</p>
          <div class="space-y-2.5 text-xs text-slate-700 max-h-[420px] overflow-y-auto pr-1">
            <div class="p-3 bg-slate-50 hover:bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-200 transition">
              <strong class="text-brand-700 font-mono">AICTE APH 2024-27 Clause 2.14 / App. 4</strong>
              <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-600 mt-1">Statutory filings must belong exclusively to applicant (cross-institution reuse prohibition).</p>
            </div>
            <div class="p-3 bg-slate-50 hover:bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-200 transition">
              <strong class="text-brand-700 font-mono">AICTE APH 2024-27 Clause 1.4 / App. 1</strong>
              <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-600 mt-1">Mandatory Technical Education Regulatory (TER) fee realization in AICTE treasury.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="p-3 bg-slate-50 hover:bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-200 transition">
              <strong class="text-brand-700 font-mono">AICTE APH 2024-27 Clause 2.1 / App. 15</strong>
              <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-600 mt-1">Fire Safety Certificate mandatory validity window and State NOC compliance.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="p-3 bg-slate-50 hover:bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-200 transition">
              <strong class="text-brand-700 font-mono">AICTE APH 2024-27 Clause 2.8 / App. 3</strong>
              <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-600 mt-1">Declared intake consistency with central AICTE approved baseline limits.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="p-3 bg-slate-50 hover:bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-200 transition">
              <strong class="text-brand-700 font-mono">AICTE APH 2024-27 Clause 6.1 / App. 7</strong>
              <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-600 mt-1">Infrastructure photographic evidence clarity, uniqueness, and completeness standards.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>


